  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A SMART approach to farm support services in Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this demonstration project, Agriprom B.V. and UniformAgri B.V. wish to convince the owners of dairy plants and their suppliers that the UniformAgri Farm Management Software for Milk Factories, combined with training of dairy plant advisors and farmers, makes it possible to monitor (cow) performance of all raw milk suppliers, that are connected to a central system at the dairy plant.Advisory services become far more effective, resulting in more milk of higher quality for the dairy plant and higher incomes for the farmer.</narrative>
  </description>
